{
  "content": {
    "arguments": "$ARGUMENTS",
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "31412af7-fdd4-4818-9508-965345646f78",
        "text": "Use the Bash tool. The Pebbles CLI at \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" is the ONLY sanctioned way to change spec files — never edit .pebble files directly."
      },
      {
        "id": "fac1229a-8467-439e-8f58-3b86d1036194",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Spec mutation contract (rules/system/spec-mutation-contract)"
      },
      {
        "id": "a4c7a9ee-a2dc-42b5-b4c3-f7b09613a305",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Table completeness (rules/system/table-completeness)"
      },
      {
        "id": "75d7fa83-91ea-4287-9858-48d20ca94962",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Reference integrity (rules/system/reference-integrity)"
      },
      {
        "id": "31560e0f-5091-4c57-bb2b-cfd9305e2871",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Status discipline (rules/system/status-discipline)"
      },
      {
        "id": "910e4b10-0c16-4f41-8ccf-b11317c767e6",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Graph-first navigation (rules/system/graph-first-navigation)"
      },
      {
        "id": "8fe3f71d-0398-4a18-8d10-1dd08de322b6",
        "text": "Bound by system rule: Extraction — completeness standard (rules/system/extraction-standard)"
      }
    ],
    "examples": [],
    "kind": "skill",
    "onFailure": [
      {
        "id": "9a590774-3209-4f63-911e-2d9b9fe37c48",
        "text": "Read the CLI error — it names the fix; correct the call and retry once"
      },
      {
        "id": "9414b71d-7809-4b5b-b8de-7377f3a53bb0",
        "text": "NEVER fall back to editing .pebble files directly, whatever failed"
      },
      {
        "id": "dbe25fe9-ea6f-41f0-9bc3-4e26177831db",
        "text": "If still blocked, report the exact command and error to the user and stop"
      }
    ],
    "output": "Batches of created models/structures/apis/workflows, linked and code-linked, with a progress report of what remains.",
    "prerequisites": [
      {
        "id": "94369982-000b-4bb9-899a-c4e15218b5e7",
        "text": "A fresh map (map --fresh) — the hubs drive the domain inventory"
      }
    ],
    "purpose": "Onboard an existing app: extract the whole project into pebbles (first run)",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "f864480b-2e97-4fd0-b47e-2449a9255896",
        "text": "Onboard this project — extract the ENTIRE existing codebase into the spec graph: $ARGUMENTS"
      },
      {
        "id": "880777ce-ac0d-4179-b2a7-60a9da12d393",
        "text": "This is first-time onboarding of an existing app (a whole-app reverse extraction — NOT scoping a ticket). Steps, in order: (1) \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" map --fresh — required; note byLanguage + hubs (the most-imported files ARE the domain core). (2) From hubs and map-search, inventory the domain: models/entities, DTOs/structures, APIs (routes/controllers), and the key workflows. (3) Work in batches by domain area — for each item, read the source the graph points to, then \"{PEBBLES_CLI}\" create <section> --title \"...\" --content {…} with the real extracted shape, and link-code its source files. Use map-neighbors to find what belongs together. (4) Status implemented for everything extracted. (5) Report progress per batch (created N models, M structures…) and what remains — for a large app, propose continuing in a follow-up run rather than truncating silently."
      }
    ],
    "verify": [
      {
        "id": "d9c5f340-187c-430a-84d6-e39868609405",
        "text": "Each batch reports created pebbles with counts; nothing failed silently"
      },
      {
        "id": "89a66407-65ff-4f5d-9205-81f1e8c855a0",
        "text": "Cross-model FKs between created models are refKey-wired (second pass after both exist)"
      }
    ],
    "whenToUse": "First-run onboarding of an existing app: inventory the domain from the map's hubs and batch-create the spec graph."
  },
  "createdAt": "2026-07-21T14:32:38.780Z",
